{"seq":4,"slug":"manufacturing-testing","title":"制造与测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dfm-design-rules","title":"DFM 设计规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/dfm-design-rules","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"pcb-manufacturing-process","title":"PCB 制造工艺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/pcb-manufacturing-process","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-debugging-methods","title":"测试与调试方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/testing-debugging-methods","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"制造与测试\">制造与测试</h1><p>PCB 设计的最终目标是生产出满足性能要求的物理电路板。DFM（Design for Manufacturing）规范确保设计可被高效制造，制造工艺知识帮助设计师理解工艺约束，而系统化的测试与调试方法则保障产品质量。</p>\n<p>本章覆盖三个关键环节：DFM 设计规范（可制造性设计准则）、PCB 制造工艺（从内层到成品的全流程）、以及测试与调试方法（从裸板测试到系统级验证）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DFM 设计规范</td>\n<td>可制造性</td>\n<td>最小线宽/间距、孔径要求、焊盘设计、拼板规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCB 制造工艺</td>\n<td>工艺流程</td>\n<td>开料、内层成像、压合、钻孔、电镀、表面处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试与调试方法</td>\n<td>质量保障</td>\n<td>AOI/ICT/飞针测试、信号测量、故障定位、热分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"制造-测试闭环\">制造-测试闭环</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[PCB 设计] --&gt; B[DFM 检查]&#10;    B --&gt; C[制造工艺]&#10;    C --&gt; D[裸板测试]&#10;    D --&gt; E[SMT 贴装]&#10;    E --&gt; F[功能测试]&#10;    F --&gt;|问题反馈| A\">flowchart LR\n    A[PCB 设计] --&gt; B[DFM 检查]\n    B --&gt; C[制造工艺]\n    C --&gt; D[裸板测试]\n    D --&gt; E[SMT 贴装]\n    E --&gt; F[功能测试]\n    F --&gt;|问题反馈| A</pre>"}